      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相反地，草地较好跑也容易加速，但比起沙土容易冲过头，\n对双脚造成的反作用力也大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9450210e4a8f24729dd426798b505fe41742ca6ffe0fd0f1c5d771bde0bf3d8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
